#: ../../source/plugins.rst:4 7df6f572d0dc46899d09a9c4901f04e6
msgid "Plugins"
msgstr "插件"

#: ../../source/plugins.rst:6 c16349adccde4156b1b3678e6ca6fbfa
msgid ""
"socid_extractor can load additional extraction schemes from plugins. A "
"plugin scheme uses the **exact same format** as the built-in schemes — the "
"same ``flags``, ``regex``, ``fields`` and other keys documented in "
":doc:`adding-a-scheme`. Once loaded, plugin schemes are merged into the same"
" scheme dictionary the library iterates over, so ``extract()`` treats them "
"identically to the built-ins (see :doc:`how-extraction-works`)."
msgstr ""
"socid_extractor 可以从插件加载额外的提取方案。插件方案使用与内置方案 **完全相同的格式** —— 即 :doc:`adding-a-"
"scheme` 中记录的相同的 ``flags``\\ 、\\ ``regex``\\ 、\\ ``fields`` "
"及其他键。加载后，插件方案会被合并到库所遍历的同一个方案字典中，因此 ``extract()`` 对它们的处理与内置方案完全一致（参见 "
":doc:`how-extraction-works`）。"

#: ../../source/plugins.rst:13 e8fc7ea9469241bcb3676426f3e16f45
msgid "There are two ways to ship a plugin:"
msgstr "有两种发布插件的方式："

#: ../../source/plugins.rst:15 0ff9aee81ea24244b78f79373f0a892b
msgid ""
"**Directory-based** — drop ``.py`` files into "
"``~/.socid_extractor/plugins/``."
msgstr "**基于目录** —— 将 ``.py`` 文件放入 ``~/.socid_extractor/plugins/``\\ 。"

#: ../../source/plugins.rst:16 c5271852e8ad4d909dc8341d2c6ca7fa
msgid "**Pip-installable** — publish a package that registers an entry point."
msgstr "**可通过 Pip 安装** —— 发布一个注册了入口点（entry point）的软件包。"

#: ../../source/plugins.rst:18 0759ece2796d47d78035db44d234227f
msgid ""
"Both mechanisms simply contribute a ``schemes`` dict; nothing else about the"
" extraction pipeline changes."
msgstr "两种机制都只是贡献一个 ``schemes`` 字典；提取流程的其他部分不会有任何变化。"

#: ../../source/plugins.rst:22 f37fff1a69804e2482e87608a0e1346a
msgid "Directory-based plugins"
msgstr "基于目录的插件"

#: ../../source/plugins.rst:24 98ea75e6f696493bb15451f1e424ad4f
msgid "Place ``.py`` files in ``~/.socid_extractor/plugins/``::"
msgstr "将 ``.py`` 文件放入 ``~/.socid_extractor/plugins/``::"

#: ../../source/plugins.rst:30 836ab5f09f9944d3a9ee604d02428424
msgid "Each file must export a module-level ``schemes`` dict:"
msgstr "每个文件都必须导出一个模块级的 ``schemes`` 字典："

#: ../../source/plugins.rst:48 5a223eba0339459899c0dd6e3cbe85ee
msgid ""
"The scheme structure is identical to the built-ins; see :doc:`adding-a-"
"scheme` for the full set of supported keys, and "
"``examples/example_plugin.py`` in the repository for a complete template."
msgstr ""
"方案结构与内置方案完全相同；完整的受支持键集合请参见 :doc:`adding-a-scheme`，完整的模板请参见仓库中的 "
"``examples/example_plugin.py``\\ 。"

#: ../../source/plugins.rst:53 02d3b0803ad14345b5c7c7f30092620e
msgid "Priority"
msgstr "优先级"

#: ../../source/plugins.rst:55 f843fe9034a74178a5d262b2a4aa3100
msgid ""
"Plugin schemes are inserted **before** the built-in schemes. Because "
"``extract()`` returns the first matching scheme, this has three "
"consequences:"
msgstr "插件方案会被插入到内置方案 **之前**\\ 。由于 ``extract()`` 返回第一个匹配的方案，这会带来三个影响："

#: ../../source/plugins.rst:61 9205f14f93c04398b2fd6fcc4cc74f2d
msgid "Rule"
msgstr "规则"

#: ../../source/plugins.rst:62 47cf61d7ba0c4717a001ec0997aad994
msgid "Behaviour"
msgstr "行为"

#: ../../source/plugins.rst:63 a147dd55c9584a309cdf1be9dcc2048f
msgid "Plugins first"
msgstr "插件优先"

#: ../../source/plugins.rst:64 696ac87bae654e3c9b955a0f557465ad
msgid ""
"Plugin schemes are checked before built-ins, so a plugin match wins over a "
"built-in match on the same page."
msgstr "插件方案会先于内置方案进行检查，因此在同一页面上，插件的匹配会优先于内置方案的匹配。"

#: ../../source/plugins.rst:66 20ee856c367a44589c86e8e24f51982d
msgid "Same-name override"
msgstr "同名覆盖"

#: ../../source/plugins.rst:67 d3556d1cfb0a4b6783a1254539aecafe
msgid ""
"If a plugin defines a scheme with the same name as a built-in, the plugin "
"version replaces the built-in one (a warning is logged)."
msgstr "如果插件定义了与内置方案同名的方案，则插件版本会替换内置版本（并记录一条警告）。"

#: ../../source/plugins.rst:69 84bc395e41d7444998c84b02835975a1
msgid "Alphabetical load order"
msgstr "按字母顺序加载"

#: ../../source/plugins.rst:70 baa52b97e2d04bb8bdd518a2b8180647
msgid ""
"Directory files are loaded in sorted filename order, so ``00_high.py`` loads"
" before ``50_normal.py``. Use numeric prefixes to control which plugin wins "
"when two of them define the same scheme name."
msgstr ""
"目录中的文件按文件名排序顺序加载，因此 ``00_high.py`` 会先于 ``50_normal.py`` "
"加载。当两个插件定义了相同的方案名时，可使用数字前缀来控制哪个插件胜出。"

#: ../../source/plugins.rst:75 d29799647ae140348d77c61e597f2608
msgid "Available imports"
msgstr "可用的导入"

#: ../../source/plugins.rst:77 294eab115fbb44c8a5f927fbc284833a
msgid ""
"A plugin file is an ordinary Python module, so it can import any installed "
"package. Common imports include the standard library and socid_extractor's "
"own helpers:"
msgstr ""
"插件文件是一个普通的 Python 模块，因此它可以导入任何已安装的软件包。常见的导入包括标准库以及 socid_extractor 自带的辅助函数："

#: ../../source/plugins.rst:87 0dd6ee60f68a408db85b342b805653ef
msgid "Error handling"
msgstr "错误处理"

#: ../../source/plugins.rst:89 e843b0b397c04e6eb55e867de4101e7f
msgid ""
"Plugin loading never aborts the run — a broken plugin is skipped and the "
"rest continue:"
msgstr "插件加载绝不会中断运行 —— 有问题的插件会被跳过，其余插件继续加载："

#: ../../source/plugins.rst:95 0fce0b59764d4d5e9eb34f45f0e20a98
msgid "Situation"
msgstr "情形"

#: ../../source/plugins.rst:96 d836d9b18e8a4f74b4f4f11a971d4688
msgid "Result"
msgstr "结果"

#: ../../source/plugins.rst:97 3887ad2f9918436ab882e44e866c8ddd
msgid "``~/.socid_extractor/plugins/`` does not exist"
msgstr "``~/.socid_extractor/plugins/`` 不存在"

#: ../../source/plugins.rst:98 bdaa484766414c1b8e9ae1902ebb4bb0
msgid "Silently skipped."
msgstr "静默跳过。"

#: ../../source/plugins.rst:99 fadfe85e151e49028760ab8c3b236650
msgid "Syntax error or exception while importing a file"
msgstr "导入文件时出现语法错误或异常"

