#: ../../source/plugins.rst:104 417c44a5faaf49dcb3bfc133203171f7
msgid ""
"To see which plugins were loaded and which were skipped, enable debug "
"logging:"
msgstr "要查看哪些插件已加载、哪些被跳过，请启用调试日志："

#: ../../source/plugins.rst:112 f1d1ff2b2b5b4e548f885125647a8058
msgid "Pip-installable plugins"
msgstr "可通过 Pip 安装的插件"

#: ../../source/plugins.rst:114 88d1f5227a584da6becde1f81d241b1a
msgid ""
"A third-party package can register schemes through the "
"``socid_extractor.plugins`` entry point group. Point the entry point at a "
"module attribute that is a ``schemes`` dict:"
msgstr ""
"第三方软件包可以通过 ``socid_extractor.plugins`` 入口点组来注册方案。将入口点指向一个作为 ``schemes`` "
"字典的模块属性："

#: ../../source/plugins.rst:123 deb0ceab1baa46108b48cb7771e19bf9
msgid ""
"Here ``my_package/extractors.py`` exports a ``schemes`` dict in the same "
"format as a directory-based plugin. Once the package is installed, its "
"schemes are discovered and loaded automatically — no configuration or "
"directory setup required:"
msgstr ""
"这里 ``my_package/extractors.py`` 导出一个 ``schemes`` "
"字典，其格式与基于目录的插件相同。软件包安装后，其方案会被自动发现并加载 —— 无需任何配置或目录设置："

#: ../../source/plugins.rst:132 54fee3d8a8cb4d2086e6a7b9ea106143
msgid ""
"Entry-point schemes follow the same priority rules as directory plugins: "
"they are inserted before the built-ins, and a same-name scheme overrides the"
" built-in one."
msgstr "入口点方案遵循与目录插件相同的优先级规则：它们会被插入到内置方案之前，且同名方案会覆盖内置方案。"
